Hi Marius,

That is not an error, The message tells that PowerTOP has not saved values =
as baseline.   But you still can run the program.

You could run it  using:

1-      To generate an html file: powertop - -html

2-      From the command line: powertop

I executed PowerTOP on Ubuntu running chrome  and got the attached file.

I would recommend to join and post other your questions to the mailing list=
 so that other people can benefit.

Thank you,
Alexandra.


